        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "今天是石墙运动纪念日（1969年6月28日）。57年前的今天，纽约市石墙酒吧（Stonewall Inn）遭到警方突袭，性少数群体与盟友们奋起抵抗，持续多日的抗争由此展开。这场起义点燃了现代LGBTQ+权利运动的火种，催生了首届骄傲游行，并持续推动全球平权事业。\n我们坚定支持所有性少数权益！愿人人享有平等、尊严与自由，无论爱谁、做自己。🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️\nToday marks the anniversary of the Stonewall Riots (June 28, 1969). 57 years ago today, a police raid on the Stonewall Inn, a gay bar in New York City, sparked days of resistance from LGBTQ+ patrons and allies. This uprising became the catalyst for the modern LGBTQ+ rights movement, leading to the first Pride marches and ongoing global advocacy.\nWe stand in solidarity with all sexual minorities. Equality, dignity, and freedom for everyone — no matter who they love or who they are. 🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️"
        },
